.TH MYFILEFUNCTIONS 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
wordCount, mygrep \- file analysis utility functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars ");"
.br
.BI "int mygrep(FILE *" fp ", const char *" search_str ", char ***" matches ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
These functions perform basic text analysis on open file streams.
.TP
.B wordCount
Counts the number of lines, words, and characters in
.I file
, storing the results in
.IR lines ", " words ", and " chars .
Returns 0 on success, \-1 on failure.
.TP
.B mygrep
Searches
.I fp
line by line for
.IR search_str .
Matching lines are stored in a dynamically allocated array pointed to by
.IR matches .
Returns the number of matches, or \-1 on failure. The caller is responsible for freeing the returned lines and array.
